      "writtenOn": "2026-02-12T19:51:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is confusing but intentional:\n\n- `target_cpu \u003d\u003d \"wasm\"` used to be equivalent to `is_wasm`, but now it is equivalent to `is_any_wasm`.\n- CanvasKit defines its own GL test context in modules/canvaskit/gm_bindings.cpp (`WasmWebGlTestContext`), which is (I believe) why it was excluded from this block before.\n- In a subsequent CL, I\u0027ll be adding a webgl test context implementation for `is_standalone_wasm` builds - and therefore we need `is_standalone_wasm` to be able to enter this block. So, now the guard becomes `!is_wasm` which excludes CanvasKit-WASM but not standalone WASM.\n\nLMK if that makes sense!",
      "parentUuid": "cd7deedb_55f0da62",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2236,
        "startChar": 25,
        "endLine": 2236,
        "endChar": 34
      },
      "revId": "0934dd0fed7304e4a20e29b602ddb012db4238a6",
